    <detaileddescription>
<para>Full pipeline: 4 prompt builds, 4 generate() calls, 4 score parses, 4 rationale parses, weighted aggregation, threshold check, step recommendation.</para>
<para>Expected: &lt; 40 µs (4× single-dimension cost + dedup pass).</para>
<para>This is the hot path in production when a real LLM is injected — the benchmark measures only ThemisDB&apos;s own overhead (prompt stitching, parsing, aggregation) in isolation from actual LLM latency. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
